{"id":"a911ce008f1d4c619bafd28282ca3028","owner":"haakon.olsvold@pbe.oslo.kommune.no_OsloKommune","ownerId":"1f0e8f2e68074d519c242c9c05cd9ca0","created":1763382516000,"modified":1781249178000,"guid":null,"name":null,"title":"Bryn","type":"StoryMap","typeKeywords":["arcgis-storymaps","smdraftresourceid:draft_1781249174712.json","smfirstpublisheddate:1763382579950","smpublisheddate:1781249174711","smstatuspublished","smversiondraft:26.21.1274","smversionpublished:26.21.1274","StoryMap","Web Application"],"description":"<p><\/p><p>Bryn har tilgang til både T-bane og jernbanestasjon, og ligger i gangavstand til Helsfyr (T-bane og buss). <br /><br />De to knutepunktene vil, gjennom et samspill, kunne styrke hverandre. Oslo kommune ønsker derfor å se Bryn og Helsfyr under ett og utvikle området til å bli et regionalt knutepunkt for å blant annet avlaste sentrum for busstrafikk. <\/p>","tags":[""],"snippet":"Et regionalt knutepunkt","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail.jpeg","documentation":null,"extent":[],"categories":[],"spatialReference":null,"accessInformation":null,"classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"nb","properties":{"thumbnail":["url","https://su.example/content/items/a911ce008f1d4c619bafd28282ca3028/resources/gjWJLw274VYXGpVrEHykO.jpg{{qp|[[\"wago\"],[\"ust\"]]}}"],"shouldHideCover":false,"scriptEmbedDomains":[],"isScriptEmbedEnabled":false},"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://storymaps.arcgis.com/stories/a911ce008f1d4c619bafd28282ca3028","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":9287978,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"commentsEnabled":true,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":469,"scoreCompleteness":35,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1784743200000}